cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this dataset, please cite it as below."
type: dataset
title: "Religion-based financial exclusion in OIC economies: a harmonised economy-year dataset from the Global Findex, 2011-2024"
version: 1.0.0
date-released: 2026-08-17
license: CC-BY-4.0
doi: 10.5281/zenodo.21971441
url: "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.21971441"
repository-code: "https://github.com/achouakbenkaddour/findex-oic-religious-exclusion"
authors:
  - family-names: Benkaddour
    given-names: Achouak
    affiliation: "University of Tamanghasset, Algeria"
abstract: >-
  Harmonised economy-year aggregates measuring the share of adults without a
  financial-institution account who cite religious reasons, built from five
  rounds of the World Bank Global Findex microdata (2011, 2014, 2017, 2021,
  2024). 709 economy-round cells across 40 fields, with a flagged balanced
  frame of 34 OIC member states observed in every round in which the outcome
  exists, plus a hand-coded Islamic banking regime variable sourced to central
  bank and regulator documents. Contains no individual-level records: the
  Findex microdata are not redistributed. Estimates are conditional
  associations, not identified effects; the religion item is asked only of the
  unbanked and the design is repeated cross-sections.
keywords:
  - financial inclusion
  - Islamic finance
  - Global Findex
  - OIC
  - religious exclusion
  - unbanked
  - survey harmonisation
references:
  - type: database
    title: "The Global Findex Database"
    authors:
      - family-names: Demirguc-Kunt
        given-names: Asli
      - family-names: Klapper
        given-names: Leora
      - family-names: Singer
        given-names: Dorothe
      - family-names: Ansar
        given-names: Saniya
    publisher:
      name: World Bank
    notes: >-
